{"total_count":1,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BurntSushi/ripgrep/issues/2957","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BurntSushi/ripgrep","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BurntSushi/ripgrep/issues/2957/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BurntSushi/ripgrep/issues/2957/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BurntSushi/ripgrep/issues/2957/events","html_url":"https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/pull/2957","id":2763803468,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAzJbyc6GdyGG","number":2957,"title":"feat(completion): support sourcing zsh completion dynamically","user":{"login":"vegerot","id":5297725,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyOTc3MjU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5297725?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vegerot","html_url":"https://github.com/vegerot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vegerot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vegerot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vegerot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vegerot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vegerot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vegerot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vegerot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vegerot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vegerot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2024-12-30T23:36:56Z","updated_at":"2025-01-03T04:29:44Z","closed_at":"2024-12-31T13:23:13Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BurntSushi/ripgrep/pulls/2957","html_url":"https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/pull/2957","diff_url":"https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/pull/2957.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/BurntSushi/ripgrep/pull/2957.patch","merged_at":"2024-12-31T13:23:13Z"},"body":"Summary:\r\nPreviously, you needed to save the completion script to a file and then\r\nsource it.  Now, you can dynamically source completions in zsh by\r\nrunning\r\n\r\n```zsh\r\n$ source <(rg --generate complete-zsh)\r\n```\r\n\r\nTest plan:\r\n1. Run `source <(rg --generate complete-zsh)`\r\n2. Run `rg --generate=complete-zs<TAB>`\r\n\r\nBefore this commit, you would get an error after step 1.\r\nAfter this commit, it should work as expected.\r\n\r\nCloses #2956\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BurntSushi/ripgrep/issues/2957/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BurntSushi/ripgrep/issues/2957/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}